{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Common","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.PSDFeasibilityProxy"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.deuteron_hopfBindingK_passes_necessary_conditions","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.deuteron_hopfBindingK_passes_necessary_conditions","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HopfBindingK.lean#L102-L122","doc":"**Categorical necessary-condition bracket**: combines all the\ndecidable proxies for `[3, 3]`.\n\nFor a single-generator word `σ_g^k` the element has eigenvalues\n`q^k` and `(−q⁻¹)^k`, so it is block-PSD iff `k` is even; `[3, 3]`\nhas `k = 2`. (The general even-power axiom once cited here was\nfalse — the full twist in `H_3` is PSD with odd counts — and was\nremoved 2026-11-15.)\n\nThis is contrapositive-style: doesn't PROVE PSD-feasibility,\nbut documents that the necessary-condition checks all pass. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.hopfBindingWord_minimal_in_sigma3_subset","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.hopfBindingWord_minimal_in_sigma3_subset","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HopfBindingK.lean#L76-L100","doc":"**Minimality**: no length-1 inter-nucleon word in `{σ_3,\nσ_3⁻¹}` satisfies `evenPower`.  Hence `hopfBindingWord` (length\n2) is of minimum length among PSD-feasible candidates in this\ngenerator subset.\n\nPROOF: enumerate the four length-1 candidates `[3], [-3]`\n(the only options if we restrict to `Int.natAbs g = 3`) and\ncheck `evenPower` fails for each.  `decide` handles the\nfinite enumeration. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.hopfBindingWord_lengthBound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.hopfBindingWord_lengthBound","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HopfBindingK.lean#L72-L74","doc":"The Hopf binding word respects the L_K_max ≤ 4 length bound. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.hopfBindingWord_structurallyValid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.hopfBindingWord_structurallyValid","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HopfBindingK.lean#L64-L70","doc":"The Hopf binding word is structurally valid at `n_0 = 6`:\nnon-empty, all generators non-zero, all in `[3, 6)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.hopfBindingWord_evenPower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.hopfBindingWord_evenPower","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HopfBindingK.lean#L57-L62","doc":"The Hopf binding word satisfies `evenPower`: count(3) = 2,\ncount(-3) = 0, sum = 2 ≡ 0 mod 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.hopfBindingWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HopfBindingK.hopfBindingWord","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HopfBindingK.lean#L54-L55","doc":"The Hopf binding word `σ_3² = [3, 3]` for the deuteron. ","signatureChunk":0}]}